      "content": "but what if there's nothing to endure? what if there's no dignity left in just waiting to be slaughtered? it feels more like cowardice to just sit here and wait for them to do it to me. i just keep thinking maybe there's a way to meet it on my own terms. a way to keep some shred of control instead of just being a victim.",
